# Dictionary generation pipeline (WL-102/WL-105/WL-501).
#
# Ignored: the ESDB source checkout + build (~150MB), the WordNet database
# download (~16MB) and the intermediate JSON (~36MB), all reproducible via
# `npm run dictionary:generate`.
#
# NOT ignored: src/assets/dictionary/dictionary.pack.json (~1.7MB) and
# definitions.pack.json (~3.0MB), the packed assets the app actually
# imports. Metro needs them to bundle, so a fresh checkout and CI's native
# build jobs must have them without running the generators (which need
# Python, SQLite and a network fetch).
.cache/
src/assets/dictionary/dictionary.json
src/assets/dictionary/manifest.json
# Python bytecode from the dictionary/definition generators.
__pycache__/
